        "anchor": "_TASK_MANAGE_MODELS =",
        "source": "src/terminal_mcp/mcp/roles.py",
        "text": "create requires non-null isolation_hint. update requires non-null expected_revision (minimum 1) and task_id. For every action the accepted field whitelist, required fields and extra_forbidden policy are compiled from _TASK_MANAGE_MODELS, not from the permissive union."
